        "text": "theorem inverse_derivativeWord_bound (d : Direction) {a : Frequency → ℂ} (ha : Rapid a)\n    (w : List Bool) (x : Plane) :\n    ‖derivativeWord w (directionalInverse d a) x‖ ≤\n      ((6 * ‖omega⁻¹‖) * ‖omega‖ ^ w.length) * coeffSeminorm (w.length + 1) a"
